    "en": {
      "text": "Kills grant one stack of 'Gun And Run' for 10 (<enhanced/> 11) seconds. Maximum of 3 stacks. If the buff expires, the next kill will grant however many stacks were previously held.\n\nAfter sprinting for 0.75 seconds without a full magazine, consume one stack and <title refill [G_refill] /> 25% magazine capacity every 0.85 seconds.\n\nFor bows, this trait instead grants a 15% Faster Draw Time for ? seconds.\n\nProvides no benefit to Swords.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T19:04:12.103Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
